{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24417","headline":"酬梦得以予五月长斋延僧徒绝宾友见戏十韵 · 白居易","name":"酬梦得以予五月长斋延僧徒绝宾友见戏十韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宾客懒逢迎，翛然池馆清。\n檐闲空燕语，林静未蝉鸣。\n荤血还休食，杯觞亦罢倾。\n三春多放逸，五月暂修行。\n香印朝烟细，纱灯夕焰明。\n交游诸长老，师事古先生。\n禅後心弥寂，斋来体更轻。\n不唯忘肉味，兼拟灭风情。\n蒙以声闻待，难将戏论争。\n虚空若有佛，灵运恐先成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24417.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24417","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}